  "operation": {
    "kind": "prompt",
    "user": "Judge the implementation.\n\n## The changes\n\n{{.inputs.changes}}\n\n## The tests\n\n{{.inputs.unit_tests}}\n\n## The docs touched\n\n{{.inputs.docs_touched}}\n\n## The units\n\n{{.inputs.units}}\n\n## The previous pass\n\n{{.inputs.prior_findings}}\n\n## What to check\n\n- Every change has an observable `done_when` and lands on its own.\n- Every invariant in the unit docs has a test, or is listed as unassertable with a reason.\n- The docs the change made false were corrected.\n- The code follows `docs/engineering/standards.md`, or the departure is stated.\n\n## What to produce\n\n`findings`: each `{ severity, claim, evidence, target_id }`.\n\n`max_severity`, `max_severity_rank` (blocker 3, significant 2, minor 1, note 0).\n\n`target`: `draft` when the code should change; `upstream` when a unit doc is wrong; `ask` when a person has to decide.\n",
    "config": {
      "model": "claude-opus-5"
    },
    "input": {},
    "output": {
      "name": "output",
      "kind": "json",
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "findings": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "severity",
                "claim"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "severity": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "blocker",
                    "significant",
                    "minor",
                    "note"
                  ]
                },
                "claim": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "evidence": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "target_id": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "max_severity": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "blocker",
              "significant",
              "minor",
              "note"
            ]
          },
          "max_severity_rank": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "target": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "draft",
              "explore",
              "upstream",
              "ask"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "findings",
          "max_severity",
          "max_severity_rank",
          "target"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "environment": {
    "session": null,
